<attribute name="authors" nodeId="1850e1f2"></attribute>
<attribute name="changeDate" nodeId="54bebb72">Wed Apr 12 15:03:41 EDT 2017</attribute>
<attribute name="changeDescription" nodeId="f90132db">APR 2017 - updated role from Organizational Change Manager to Training Designer|FEB 2017 - updated purpose, brief and main descriptions</attribute>
<attribute name="version" nodeId="b520b004"></attribute>
<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="9c86beb8">&lt;p&gt;
    Provide an initial perspective and design principles for the training schedule, delivery, methods and tools. Gather and
    synthesize relevant information from all dependent parties to develop training course designs.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Using the training curriculum and training needs analysis. develop a detailed training course outline for each
        course to include:
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li style=&quot;LIST-STYLE-TYPE: none&quot;&gt;
        &lt;ul&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                what would be covered in each course,
            &lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;
                using what method, timings, etc.
            &lt;/li&gt;
        &lt;/ul&gt;
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Review training outline and scope with key stakeholders as appropriate.
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Amend and finalize detailed course outline for sign-off from business.
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="externalId" nodeId="19a7c504"></attribute>
<attribute name="keyConsiderations" nodeId="7d623276">The design should address the objectives of the training, the proposed timing, and flow of the topics. For example,
training introduction may be followed by team icebreakers. This design should enable the developers to quickly and easily
develop the training content. &lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
Effective training should cover end-to-end processes and not just focus on keystroke training for each functional area.
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
Training is an excellent engagement opportunity and can focus on broader learning, communication and
awareness&amp;nbsp;opportunities. Consider how to reinforce behavioral change aspects when designing the training, including
creative ways to bring the new process to life. &lt;br /&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="longPresentationName" nodeId="c248931f"></attribute>
<attribute name="purpose" nodeId="b6165a32">To align the training collateral with the stakeholder needs and ensure that it provides the knowledge and skills required
by the participants.</attribute>
